            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:48:14.835874+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r2-b16",
            "text": "I wanted to breastfeed him when he was hungry and I noticed that he wasn't approving of my breast, so I gave him a bottle with formula in it.",
