            "created_at": "2026-09-09T12:48:14.835883+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-luna-json-r2-b16",
            "text": "Pressure regulation using the valve and different amounts of fluid goes a long way in keeping your hydraulic log splitter in action.",
